{
  "_comment": "Parabellum behavioural heuristic signatures. Runtime data file shipped in the installer (installed under /Library/Application Support/Parabellum/signatures/heuristics.json) and loaded by the daemon at startup. Kept OUT of the executables so our own benign binaries carry no info-stealer signature strings (which would trip XProtect). Detection LOGIC stays in code (pb-monitor::sensitive, pb-daemon::guard::rules); only the pattern DATA lives here. Catalogue of what macOS info-stealers (AMOS/Atomic, Poseidon, Banshee, Cthulhu, Cuckoo) target and the Apple tools they drive.",
